  "pdf": "ALLSEIS-OB4C_EN_202601.pdf",
  "excerpt": "ALLSEIS-OB4C is the premier choice for E&P companies and service providers in search of cutting-edge subsurface imaging technology. Our nodes are carefully designed to offer exceptional efficiency and environmental sustainability, catering to a wide range of survey needs from shallow waters to depths of 1,000 meters.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "highlights",
      "title": "Product Highlights",
      "bullets": [
        "Standard 3-component 14Hz high sensitivity omnidirectional geophone + 3Hz high sensitivity hydrophone, with an option for a 3Hz AlfSeis® omnidirectional geophone, providing exceptional sensing capabilities for submarine full wave field seismic acquisition;",
        "4-channel 24-bit Δ-Σ ADC converter with configurable sampling rate and preamplifier gain, offering comparable acquisition parameters to leading international products;",
        "Built-in high precision thermostatic crystal (OCXO) for timing accuracy within ±2ms over 90 days;",
        "Built-in test signal generator for on-site system diagnostics, including noise levels, dynamic range, geophone characteristics, etc.;",
        "Large capacity rechargeable lithium battery supporting 90 days of continuous recording (2,160 hours);",
        "Multiple data output formats supported, including SEG-D, SEG-Y, Mini-SEED, SAC, etc.;",
        "Internal electronic tag for efficient asset and inventory management;",
        "Compact and lightweight design (29D × 14H cm, 13.8kg in air, 7kg in water) for easy transportation and deployment."
      ]
